{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/Highlights-steam-optimized.gif?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure to retrieve lost memory and delve into the world's mysteries. Fight against the evil legion alongside your allies encountered on the journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic JRPG style grid-based and turn-based tactical battles.\u00a0Every turn you can use your movement, attack, skills, items or wait actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/gameplay.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emphasis on positioning with covers and directional defense.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/directional-defense.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 hand-crafted levels and estimated 15 - 20 hours of playtime (part 1).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide variety of unique scenes, enemies and character skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/bouncing-shot.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging gameplay that requires strategic and cautious moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysterious world through\u00a0cutscenes in every level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/cutscene-forest-camp.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lightweight progression system without any grinding.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your style of battle\u00a0with charms, items and character upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/preparation-screen-charm-2.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ original sound tracks (part 1).</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2134980?t=1752242695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2134980?t=1752242695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/64eec64e3804b66079b408dcd190b8dc1d058f63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752242695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/64eec64e3804b66079b408dcd190b8dc1d058f63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752242695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/Highlights-steam-optimized.gif?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure to retrieve lost memory and delve into the world's mysteries. Fight against the evil legion alongside your allies encountered on the journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic JRPG style grid-based and turn-based tactical battles.\u00a0Every turn you can use your movement, attack, skills, items or wait actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/gameplay.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emphasis on positioning with covers and directional defense.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/directional-defense.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 hand-crafted levels and estimated 15 - 20 hours of playtime (part 1).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide variety of unique scenes, enemies and character skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/bouncing-shot.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging gameplay that requires strategic and cautious moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysterious world through\u00a0cutscenes in every level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/cutscene-forest-camp.png?t=1752242695\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lightweight progression system without any grinding.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your style of battle\u00a0with charms, items and character upgr